      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Hello, again!",
       "transl": "Hallo, nochmal!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Hi...",
       "transl": "Привіт..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "This is the northern part of the village.",
       "transl": "Das ist der nördliche Teil des Dorfes."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "As you can see, the beasts have already come this far.",
       "transl": "Wie du gleich sehen wirst, sind die Biester bis hierhin vorgedrungen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     {
      "name": {
       "orig": "K'tara",
       "transl": "K'tara"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "These are the black cats that have taken over our village.",
       "transl": "Das sind die schwarzen Katzen, die unser Dorf überfallen haben."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "We call them \\c[3]Wiccats\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Wir nennen sie \\c[3]Schnurrken\\c[0]."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "But these are only a few. The real threat is further ahead in the \\c[3]Chief's Den\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Aber das sind nur wenige. Die wahre Bedrohung liegt weiter hinten in der \\c[3]Häuptlingshütte\\c[0]."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     {
      "name": {
       "orig": "K'tara",
       "transl": "K'tara"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "However, there is no way the other Shad will let you through.",
       "transl": "Die anderen Shad werden euch nicht passieren lassen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NERVOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "The villagers are dead set on shutting down the power plant. They will deny any other kind of outside help.",
       "transl": "Sie sind fest entschlossen, das Kraftwerk stillzulegen und werden jede Hilfe von außerhalb ablehnen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "ANNOYED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Yes, I know it's cumbersome. It's the same kind of stubbornness I know from a certain someone...",
       "transl": "Ja, ich weiß, sie sind anstrengend. Genauso stur wie eine gewisse andere Person..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Anyway, that means we have to help them... in a sneaky way. And I have a plan.",
       "transl": "Jedenfalls müssen wir ihnen helfen... auf die raffinierte Art. Und ich weiß auch schon wie."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "You see that house over there?",
       "transl": "Siehst du das Haus dort drüben?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "jungle.female-albino",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     {
      "name": {
